@node C1 "INTRODUCTION..."






                         What is SysopDownload ???
                         ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
SysopDownload is a replacement for the DS /X-Commands, but it give
you more powerful features like search for Files Path's via (Tab),Packing 
from the Files (dirs) with LHA and search 100% for the Restricted Files !
the Chapters @{" FEATURES " LINK C4} and @{" COMMANDS " LINK C5}...

@endnode
@node C2 "REQUIREMENTS..."

                             ReQuiReMeNTS
                             ~~~~~~~~~~~~
First U need...

   - an Amiga Model (500-4000T) with the installed Kickstart V37++
   - An full working Version from da /X...SysopDownload needs /X V2.3x or higher 
     and the Pipe Device to run correctly.

...things U need too...

decrunch the SysopDownload-Archive...it contains the following programs:

             1.) SysopDownload         - The Main Program
             2.) SysopDownload.info    - Configuration Icon
             4.) DS.info               - Icon for /X V3.xx

...that's all...now let's start with the @{" INSTALLATION " LINK C3}.
@endnode
@node C3 "INSTALLATION..."

                   HoW To iNSTaLL "SysopDownload"
                   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
First, I recommend to create a drawer called "DOORS:Security/"...here U can
put all files required by "SysopDownload". And Later the MST-Shell !

Copy the Files "SysopDownload" and "SysopDownload.info" into this drawer.

The further Installation depends on which /X-Version U are using :


                                @{" /X V2.3+ " LINK INSTALL2.3}

                                @{" /X V3.xx " LINK INSTALL3.X}

@endnode
@node INSTALL2.3 "INSTALL SysopDownload TO /X V2.3+"


Get a Texteditor and add the following lines to yar BBS:COMMANDS/BBS.CMD

-----------CUT HERE-------------------
*DS       XM255DOORS:Security/SysopDownload
-----------CUT HERE-------------------

Well, I don't explain the meaning of XM and so on...if U don't know it, 
close ure BBS !!!!!
@endnode
@node INSTALL3.X "INSTALL SysopDownload TO /X V3.xx"

Copy DS.info into your BBS:COMMANDS/BBSCMD/ Drawer...that's all !
easy he ? :)
@endnode


@node C4 "FEATURES OF SYSOPDOWNLOAD"

                          What Can SysopDownload
                          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
"SysopDownload" will help You to Find the Next Pathes or Files easyer,
and Help You to Restricted All Files 100%, Pack dirs or Files with LHA 
to have a complete Package from the Files what you want to DL.
you can Configure a lot of things with my SysopDownload.
And you can Flag as many Files you want to!

This Tool Knows ALL Devices that You have, so You can't insert a 
Wrong Device, Download from df0: up to DF4: is not Allowed !

I have Installed a little OnlineHelp to make my Tool easyer !


If you found a Bug in this or in other (Mystic/X-Design) Tools than Call
@{" Message " LINK DIABOLO} to me and I will fix the Prob as fast as I can.

Via the @{" ToolTypes " LINK C6} U are able to configure all you want,like Pack Dirs ,etc.

@endnode
