@endnode


@node C5 "ALL COMMANDS FROM SYSOPDOWNLOAD"

                    Commands in the InputLine to Flagged Files
                    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

   If you Know what Cshell can, than You have no Problems with that Tool to
   Search for Files/Pathes, But this Tool can More, Also read this Manual

[?]         --->  Online Help

[Tab]       --->  Shows for the Next Path/File
                  ( insert Tab and you see all Files/Pathes with the beginning 
                  from youre Input, if you have found a Path and want Jump to the next,
                  you must insert Only " " and than you must Go one char Backward, than 
                  you can press another the TAB and see the next dir or File ! I hope you 
                  understand  this Funktion )

[CRTL-X]    --->  Clear the InputLine and wait for New Input

[CRTL-S]    --->  Goes to the Path Before this Path what you used

[CRTL-P]    --->  Insert the Input before and Last Input up to the first Input
                  ( Easy if you want any Files from this Path and dont want to 
                    Type the Full path again )

[ENTER]     --->  Bring You in the Menu for DL or other Funktion`s


You See Always How many Files, Dirs and Bytes (Only the Bytes from the Files) 
you have Flagged !

                   @{"   Main Prompt Commands   " LINK MAINPROMPT}                     
@endnode


@node MAINPROMPT "MAIN PROMPT COMMANDS..."

                          MENU PROMPT COMMANDS
                          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

 [D] ---> Download the Files, if PACK_LHA is Aktiv Than the PRG Answer if
          You want to Pack it or not

 [A] ---> Quit this nice Programm

 [C] ---> Continue with Flagging

 [R] ---> If the TOOLTYPE "SHOW_RESTRICT" is installed you can see All 
          Restricted Files

 [S] ---> Shows you ALL Flagged Files


@endnode

@node C6 "ALL COMMANDS FROM SYSOPDOWNLOAD"

                               TooLTYPeS
                               ~~~~~~~~~

********************************************************************************
* IMPORTANT NOTE : DON'T DELETE OR RENAME THE ICON NAMED "SYSOPDOWNLOAD.INFO", *
*                  OTHERWISE SYSOPDOWNLOAD WON'T WORK CORRECTLY !!!!           *
********************************************************************************


RESTRICT.<x>=User.Data --> Protected the User.data for Download
                           !!!! Dont Insert a path !!!! 
                            ONLY THE CORRECT FILENAME IS ALLOWED

SHOW_RESTRICT          --> Allows to see the restricted Files

DL_PW=<Password>       --> PW for SysopDownload Max 10 chars

PACK_LHA=<path>        --> Allows to pack the Files !
                           !!! YOU MUST MOUNT THE PIPE: DEVICE !!!
                           ( Next Time I install more Packers )

PACK_DIR               --> Allows to pack Dirs, 100% searching for Restricted Files



@endnode
